 "remarks": "Commercial Retail / Salon / Medical / Service Space Available in South Norwalk (SoNo)  Outstanding opportunity to lease a prime 1,325 SF street-level commercial space located along high-traffic Fairfield Avenue. Formerly operating as a hair salon, this versatile space comes pre-plumbed with dedicated rear plumbing infrastructure (previously configured for two styling stations and two shampoo/wash bowls), saving thousands in initial build-out costs for health, wellness, or personal care operators.  Features an open retail storefront layout, high foot and drive-by visibility, separate utility controls, and private restroom facilities. Perfect turnkey setup for a hair salon, barber shop, lash/brow boutique, esthetician studio, nail salon, massage therapy, pet grooming, or boutique retail store. Situated within close proximity to SoNo's dining, retail, and Metro-North line, offering easy access to I-95 and Route 7. Contact listing agent for private showing instructions and lease terms.",
